WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.133
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.133 --> 00:10.933
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.933 --> 00:12.400
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.400 --> 00:14.567
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.400
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.400 --> 00:19.467
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.467 --> 00:21.467
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.467 --> 00:23.400
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.400 --> 00:25.033
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.500
