and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.467 --> 00:33.467
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.467 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.600
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.600 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.833 --> 00:45.567
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.567 --> 00:47.833
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

