[两人都在咀嚼]

01:06.267 --> 01:09.067
both: Mmm!
两人：嗯！

01:09.067 --> 01:10.067
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

01:10.067 --> 01:12.800
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

01:12.800 --> 01:14.067
- [slurps, yelps]
- [啜饮声，尖叫声]

01:14.067 --> 01:16.067
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

01:16.067 --> 01:17.800
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

01:17.800 --> 01:18.867
Ooh!
哦！

01:18.867 --> 01:20.633
[moaning]
[呻吟]

01:20.633 --> 01:22.133
[munching]
[咀嚼]

01:22.133 --> 01:23.733
- Excuse me!
- 打扰一下！

01:23.733 --> 01:27.267
Who, may I ask,
cooked this patty?
请问谁，
煮这个肉饼吗？

01:27.267 --> 01:29.500
all: SpongeBob Squarepants!
所有：海绵宝宝！

01:29.500 --> 01:31.733
- Did somebody
call my name?
- 有人吗
叫我的名字？

01:31.733 --> 01:34.133
- Is there a problem
with your sandwich, sir?
- 有问题吗
先生，还有你的三明治吗？

01:34.133 --> 01:35.133
- Yes!
- 是的！

01:35.133 --> 01:37.067
I feel like I could die...
我感觉我快要死了...

01:37.067 --> 01:37.933
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

01:37.933 --> 01:39.633
And go to heaven.
并去天堂。

01:39.633 --> 01:40.433
[both sigh]
[两人叹气]

01:40.433 --> 01:42.067
- [thuds, smooches]
- [重击声，吻声]

01:42.067 --> 01:43.067
- Oh, please, sir.
- 噢，拜托，先生。

01:43.067 --> 01:44.333
Don't.
Stop.
不。
停止。

01:44.333 --> 01:45.767
You really can stop, sir.
- [chuckles]
你真的可以停下来，先生。
- [轻笑]

01:45.767 --> 01:48.567
Everyone seems to really
like the Krabby Patty.
大家似乎真的
就像蟹黄饼一样。

01:48.567 --> 01:50.367
- Some people
started calling it
- 有些人
开始称呼它

01:50.367 --> 01:53.100
the "SpongeBob Patty."
“海绵宝宝帕蒂”。

01:53.100 --> 01:54.833
- What?
That's ridiculous.
- 什么？
这太荒谬了。

01:54.833 --> 01:56.733
It's always been
The Krabby Patty.
一直都是
蟹肉饼。

01:57.933 --> 01:59.267
- One SpongeBob Patty,
please.
- 一个海绵宝宝帕蒂，
请。

01:59.267 --> 02:00.800
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:00.800 --> 02:02.767
- Maybe you should
change the name of this place
- 也许你应该
更改此地点的名称

02:02.767 --> 02:06.433
from the Krusty Krab
to SpongeBob's Place.
来自蟹堡王
到海绵宝宝的地方。

02:06.433 --> 02:08.467
[explosion]
Ha, ha, ha!
[爆炸]
哈哈哈！

02:08.467 --> 02:11.500
- Hey, that's a great idea!
- 嘿，这是个好主意！

02:11.500 --> 02:13.167
SpongeBob's Place!
海绵宝宝的地方！

02:13.167 --> 02:14.733
SpongeBob's Place!
海绵宝宝的地方！

02:14.733 --> 02:16.200
customers: SpongeBob's Place!
顾客：海绵宝宝的地方！

02:16.200 --> 02:17.667
SpongeBob's Place!
海绵宝宝的地方！

02:17.667 --> 02:20.333
SpongeBob's Place!
- Oh, no, no, no, no, no!
海绵宝宝的地方！
- 哦，不，不，不，不，不！

02:20.333 --> 02:22.333
Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王！

02:22.333 --> 02:24.167
Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王！

02:24.167 --> 02:25.700
Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王！

02:25.700 --> 02:27.767
Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王！

02:27.767 --> 02:28.800
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

02:28.800 --> 02:29.933
- Come on, guys!
- 来吧，伙计们！

02:29.933 --> 02:31.067
Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王！

02:31.067 --> 02:32.233
Krusty Krab!
蟹堡王！

02:32.233 --> 02:33.767
customers: SpongeBob's Place!
顾客：海绵宝宝的地方！

02:33.767 --> 02:34.833
SpongeBob's Place!
海绵宝宝的地方！

02:34.833 --> 02:35.900
- Help!
- SpongeBob's Place!
- 帮助！
- 海绵宝宝的地方！

02:35.900 --> 02:37.167
- Admit it.
- 承认吧。

02:37.167 --> 02:39.667
Without SpongeBob,
you'd be nothing.
没有海绵宝宝，
你就什么都不是了。

02:39.667 --> 02:41.067
- Well, that's not true.
- 嗯，那不是真的。

02:41.067 --> 02:43.067
I'm the one who created
the SpongeBob Pa--
我是创造者
海绵宝宝爸爸——

02:43.067 --> 02:44.767
I mean, the Krabby Patty!
我是说，蟹肉饼！

02:44.767 --> 02:47.500
customers: * Let's all go
to SpongeBob's Place *
顾客：*我们都走吧
到海绵宝宝的地方 *

02:47.500 --> 02:49.233
*SpongeBob's Place,
SpongeBob's Place *
*海绵宝宝的地方，
海绵宝宝的地方 *

02:49.233 --> 02:50.867
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

02:50.867 --> 02:51.867
- Whoa!
- 哇！

02:51.867 --> 02:52.800
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

02:53.933 --> 02:55.267
- All right, Mr. Krabs.
- 好吧，蟹老板。

02:55.267 --> 02:57.133
If you think
the Krusty Krab is haunted
如果你认为
蟹堡王闹鬼

02:57.133 --> 02:58.300
and needs ghostbusting,
并且需要捉鬼，

02:58.300 --> 03:00.067
I'll stay away
for a while.
我会远离
有一段时间了。

03:01.500 --> 03:03.367
- Haunted, eh?
- 闹鬼，是吗？

03:03.367 --> 03:04.800
- Don't you believe
in ghosts?
-你不相信吗
在鬼魂中？

03:04.800 --> 03:05.800
- Oh, admit it!
——哦，承认吧！

03:05.800 --> 03:08.067
You're jealous
of SpongeBob!
你嫉妒了
海绵宝宝！

03:08.067 --> 03:09.500
- Of course not!
- 当然不是！

03:09.500 --> 03:10.633
But I'll be cooking
但我会做饭

03:10.633 --> 03:12.400
the Krabby Patties
from now on.
蟹肉饼
从现在开始。

03:12.400 --> 03:13.933
Krabby Patties.
蟹肉饼。

03:13.933 --> 03:15.333
Named after me,
以我的名字命名，

03:15.333 --> 03:17.067
Mr. Krabby!
克拉比先生！

03:21.067 --> 03:22.300
[loud crash]
Whoa!
[巨响]
哇！

03:22.300 --> 03:23.700
Ouch.
哎哟。

03:25.933 --> 03:27.067
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

03:27.067 --> 03:28.767
What do we do now, Gary?
我们现在做什么，加里？

03:28.767 --> 03:31.767
We've read every book
and played every game.
每本书我们都读过
并参加了每场比赛。

03:31.767 --> 03:32.700
Hey, I know!
嘿，我知道！

03:32.700 --> 03:34.833
How about another makeover?
再来一次改造怎么样？

03:34.833 --> 03:36.467
- [yowls]
- [嚎叫]

03:36.467 --> 03:39.467
- You know, I can't go
to the Krusty Krab.
- 你知道，我不能走
到蟹堡王。

03:39.467 --> 03:41.767
But I can play Krusty Krab!
但我可以玩蟹堡王！

03:41.767 --> 03:43.567
- [yowling]
- [嚎叫]

03:43.567 --> 03:46.067
- Oh!
This can be the register boat.
- 哦！
这可以是登记船。

03:46.067 --> 03:48.200
And you can be Squidward.
你也可以成为章鱼哥。

03:48.200 --> 03:50.233
[squishing]
Ooh-whoo!
[压扁]
噢噢噢！

03:50.233 --> 03:52.067
[squishing]
Ooh-whoo!
[压扁]
噢噢噢！

03:52.067 --> 03:53.700
[stretching]
Yoink!
[伸展]
哟哟！

03:54.867 --> 03:55.833
- [Squidward-like meow]
- [章鱼哥般的喵喵声]

03:55.833 --> 03:57.400
- What's that, Squidward?
- 那是什么，章鱼哥？

03:57.400 --> 03:59.400
30 Krabby Patties?
30 个蟹黄饼？

03:59.400 --> 04:00.767
Coming right up!
马上就来了！

04:02.467 --> 04:03.500
- Meow meow.
- 喵喵。

04:03.500 --> 04:05.300
[jubilant music]
[欢快的音乐]

04:05.300 --> 04:07.467
- [humming happily]
- [高兴地哼哼]

04:07.467 --> 04:09.133
[metallic shing, knives chop]
[金属盛，刀砍]

04:09.133 --> 04:12.267
[humming happily]
[高兴地哼哼]

04:12.267 --> 04:14.267
[meat sizzling]
[肉滋滋作响]

04:14.267 --> 04:18.067
[humming happily]
[高兴地哼哼]

04:18.067 --> 04:25.300
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

04:25.300 --> 04:27.600
Okay, everybody, order up!
好啦，大家赶紧下单吧！

04:29.633 --> 04:30.867
Hmm.
唔。

04:30.867 --> 04:32.633
Guess I'm used to cooking
Krabby Patties
我想我已经习惯做饭了
蟹肉饼

04:32.633 --> 04:33.967
in mass quantities.
大量。

04:36.433 --> 04:37.567
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:41.467 --> 04:43.833
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

04:43.833 --> 04:44.633
- Ooh!
- 哦！

04:44.633 --> 04:46.800
- [sniffs]
Ooh!
- [嗅嗅]
哦！

04:46.800 --> 04:47.800
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

04:47.800 --> 04:48.800
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

04:48.800 --> 04:49.767
How's about making some more
多做一些怎么样

04:49.767 --> 04:51.900
of those delicious patties?
那些美味的肉饼？

04:51.900 --> 04:53.467
- I drew two more mouths
on my face
- 我又画了两张嘴
在我脸上

04:53.467 --> 04:55.133
so I could eat
three at a time.
这样我就可以吃东西了
一次三个。

04:55.133 --> 04:56.833
[munches, squishes]
[咀嚼，挤压]

04:56.833 --> 04:57.800
- Okay, you guys.
- 好吧，你们。

04:57.800 --> 04:59.267
Just make yourself
comfortable.
只要让自己
舒适。

04:59.267 --> 05:00.833
More patties on the way!
更多肉饼正在路上！

05:04.067 --> 05:05.100
[meat sizzling]
[肉滋滋作响]

05:05.100 --> 05:06.100
[flames roar]
[火焰咆哮]

05:06.100 --> 05:07.433
- Whoa!
- 哇！

05:07.433 --> 05:09.200
- These are being sent back.
- 这些正在被退回。

05:09.200 --> 05:10.500
[extinguisher hisses]
[灭火器嘶嘶声]

05:12.067 --> 05:13.233
- [blows forcefully]
- [用力吹]

05:13.233 --> 05:14.533
What?
What's wrong with them?
什么？
他们怎么了？

05:14.533 --> 05:16.533
- Customers said
to make them good...
- 顾客说
为了让他们好...

05:16.533 --> 05:18.200
like they used to be.
就像他们以前一样。

05:18.200 --> 05:19.533
- Like they used to be?
- 就像他们以前那样吗？

05:19.533 --> 05:21.467
It's the same formula!
这是同一个公式！

05:21.467 --> 05:22.667
- Hey!
- 嘿！

05:24.200 --> 05:25.433
I see the problem!
我看到问题了！

05:25.433 --> 05:27.500
SpongeBob's not in the kitchen!
海绵宝宝不在厨房！

05:27.500 --> 05:28.500
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

05:28.500 --> 05:31.600
[all spitting and gagging]
[全部吐口水和作呕]

05:31.600 --> 05:32.967
[all groaning]
- I don't think so.
[全都呻吟]
- 我不这么认为。

05:32.967 --> 05:34.467
- I don't know why,
but it's bad.
- 我不知道为什么，
但这很糟糕。

05:34.467 --> 05:36.067
- Let me out of this place.
- [gasps]
- 让我离开这个地方。
- [喘气]

05:36.067 --> 05:37.367
Wait!
Wait!
等待！
等待！

05:37.367 --> 05:39.067
Please, don't go!
请不要走！

05:39.067 --> 05:41.367
We're having a two-for-one sale.
我们正在进行买二送一的促销活动。

05:41.367 --> 05:43.200
For every two you buy,
每买两件，

05:43.200 --> 05:44.933
you can buy another one.
你可以再买一个。

05:44.933 --> 05:47.533
[nervous chuckle]
Hold on, everybody!
[紧张的笑声]
大家坚持住！

05:47.533 --> 05:50.200
I think I hear SpongeBob's
hideous laughter
我想我听到了海绵宝宝的声音
丑陋的笑声

05:50.200 --> 05:51.833
coming from the kitchen!
从厨房传来！

05:53.400 --> 05:57.067
I'll show you that the customers
are always wrong.
我将向您展示客户
总是错的。

05:57.067 --> 05:58.800
- Oh, boy.
- 哦，男孩。

05:58.800 --> 05:59.900
Huh?
啊？

05:59.900 --> 06:01.267
- Now, go ahead.
- 现在，继续吧。

06:01.267 --> 06:02.700
Call attention to me.
引起我的注意。

06:02.700 --> 06:04.533
- Hey, everybody.
- 嘿，大家。

06:04.533 --> 06:07.800
Look who's back in the kitchen.
看看谁回到了厨房。

06:07.800 --> 06:10.133
- I'm ready!
I'm ready!
- 我准备好了！
我准备好了！

06:10.133 --> 06:11.767
[mimics SpongeBob's laugh]
- That's SpongeBob?
[模仿海绵宝宝的笑声]
- 那是海绵宝宝？

06:11.767 --> 06:14.133
Man, did he
let himself go!
伙计，他是吗？
放开自己吧！

06:14.133 --> 06:15.267
- Who cares?
- 谁在乎？

06:15.267 --> 06:16.600
I'll take a Krabby Patty!
我要吃蟹肉饼！

06:16.600 --> 06:18.367
- I'll order some too!
- 我也订一些！

06:18.367 --> 06:19.767
- Make mine a triple!
- 让我的变成三倍！

06:19.767 --> 06:21.300
- Yeah!
- My appetite's back!
- 是的！
- 我的胃口恢复了！

06:21.300 --> 06:22.533
[unenthusiastic munching]
[不热情地咀嚼]

06:22.533 --> 06:23.833
- Mmm.
- 嗯。

06:23.833 --> 06:25.133
- Yum.
- 嗯。

06:25.133 --> 06:27.933
- Is everybody enjoying
their Krabby Patties?
- 大家都喜欢吗
他们的蟹肉饼？

06:27.933 --> 06:29.633
[mimics SpongeBob's laugh]
[模仿海绵宝宝的笑声]

06:29.633 --> 06:31.433
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

06:31.433 --> 06:33.900
[lisping] Yes,
it's very nice.
[口齿不清] 是的，
非常好。

06:35.067 --> 06:36.233
- [laughs]
- [笑]

06:36.233 --> 06:39.433
It was me that cooked
those patties!
是我做饭的
那些肉饼！

06:39.433 --> 06:42.400
You're all enjoying
my food!
你们都在享受
我的食物！

06:42.400 --> 06:43.767
[customers spit]
【顾客吐口水】

06:43.767 --> 06:45.600
- I thought
something was off.
- 我以为
出了什么问题。

06:45.600 --> 06:46.667
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

06:46.667 --> 06:48.133
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

06:48.133 --> 06:49.433
Oh, no, you don't!
哦，不，你不！

06:49.433 --> 06:50.500
[loud crash]
[巨响]

06:50.500 --> 06:52.600
[thuds]
[重击声]

06:52.600 --> 06:55.500
[engine rumbling]
[发动机轰鸣]

06:55.500 --> 06:57.133
[truck beeping]
[卡车嘟嘟声]

06:57.133 --> 06:59.367
[lava gushing]
[熔岩喷涌]

06:59.367 --> 07:00.533
[thuds]
Ha!
[重击声]
哈！

07:00.533 --> 07:01.667
Anyone who
wants to leave
任何人
想离开

07:01.667 --> 07:03.800
has to go
through me first.
必须走了
首先通过我。

07:04.833 --> 07:07.300
[all chattering indistinctly]
[大家都在含糊不清地喋喋不休]

07:07.300 --> 07:08.500
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:08.500 --> 07:10.200
Ahh!
啊！

07:10.200 --> 07:11.200
Ow!
Eee!
噢！
哎呀！

07:11.200 --> 07:12.233
Hey!
Oh!
嘿！
哦！

07:12.233 --> 07:13.267
Whoa!
Ah!
哇！
啊!

07:13.267 --> 07:14.400
Blazes!
- G'night, boss!
火焰！
- 晚安，老板！

07:14.400 --> 07:15.500
See you in the morning.
- Ow!
早上见。
- 噢！

07:15.500 --> 07:16.800
Eee!
Hey!
哎呀！
嘿！

07:18.267 --> 07:20.267
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

07:20.267 --> 07:21.833
"SpongeBob's Place"?
《海绵宝宝的家》？

07:21.833 --> 07:24.067
What in the ocean?
海里有什么？

07:24.067 --> 07:25.133
Pardon me.
对不起。

07:25.133 --> 07:26.600
Don't mind me!
别管我！

07:26.600 --> 07:30.433
Just trying to
get in my own front door!
只是想
进我自己的前门！

07:30.433 --> 07:31.867
[beeping tone]
[嘟嘟声]

07:31.867 --> 07:33.500
- You've reached
the Health Department.
- 你已经达到了
卫生部门。

07:33.500 --> 07:35.600
If you'd like to leave
a message, wait for the cough.
如果你想离开
一条消息，等咳。

07:35.600 --> 07:36.667
[person coughs]
[人咳嗽]

07:36.667 --> 07:38.433
- Everybody's a comedian.
- 每个人都是喜剧演员。

07:38.433 --> 07:39.933
This is Squidward Tentacles,
这是章鱼哥的触手，

07:39.933 --> 07:41.500
and I'd like to
lodge a complaint
我想
提出投诉

07:41.500 --> 07:43.267
about my neighbor SpongeBob.
关于我的邻居海绵宝宝。

07:44.433 --> 07:45.500
[siren wails]
[警报声]

07:45.500 --> 07:47.067
- That should do it, Mr. Krabs.
- 应该可以了，蟹老板。

07:47.067 --> 07:49.600
You'll be good as new
in no time.
你会焕然一新
很快。

07:49.600 --> 07:51.600
- Wasting your time, boys.
- 浪费你们的时间，孩子们。

07:51.600 --> 07:54.067
You should just take me
straight to the morgue.
你应该带我去
直接去太平间。

07:54.067 --> 07:55.200
I'm done.
我受够了。

07:55.200 --> 07:56.333
[faint laughter]
[微弱的笑声]

07:56.333 --> 07:58.500
Stop!
Stop here!
停止！
停在这里！

07:58.500 --> 08:01.700
[indistinct chatter
and laughter]
[隐隐约约的喋喋不休
和笑声]

08:04.333 --> 08:05.333
[bell dings]
- Ah!
[铃声]
- 啊！

08:05.333 --> 08:06.867
- [moans]
- [呻吟]

08:08.800 --> 08:09.800
Make a hole!
挖个洞！

08:09.800 --> 08:11.067
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:11.067 --> 08:14.067
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

08:16.200 --> 08:18.367
- [meows]
- [喵]

08:19.667 --> 08:20.667
- Hey!
- 嘿！

08:20.667 --> 08:21.933
- Oh, hello, Mr. Krabs.
-哦，你好，蟹老板。

08:21.933 --> 08:23.400
Place your order with Gary,
please.
向加里下订单，
请。

08:23.400 --> 08:24.733
And drop your money anywhere.
并将你的钱放在任何地方。

08:24.733 --> 08:26.133
I'm running out of places
to put it.
我没地方了
把它说出来。

08:26.133 --> 08:27.800
I don't even have time
to count it.
我什至没有时间
去数它。

08:27.800 --> 08:29.133
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:29.133 --> 08:30.633
[gasps]
[喘气]

08:30.633 --> 08:31.667
[salt rattles]
[盐嘎嘎声]

08:31.667 --> 08:33.267
- Here, try one.
- 来，尝试一下。

08:33.267 --> 08:34.567
- [munches]
- [咀嚼]

08:34.567 --> 08:36.567
Oh, it's delicious.
噢，真好吃。

08:36.567 --> 08:37.800
- Sorry,
I ran out of napkins.
- 抱歉，
我的餐巾纸用完了。

08:37.800 --> 08:39.900
You'll have to use
a $100 bill.
你必须使用
一张 100 美元的钞票。

08:39.900 --> 08:43.733
- You deserve your own place.
- 你值得拥有自己的位置。

08:43.733 --> 08:47.567
[blows nose]
[擤鼻子]

08:47.567 --> 08:49.100
- Mr. Krabs, don't go!
- 蟹老板，别走！

08:49.100 --> 08:50.133
I need you.
我需要你。

08:50.133 --> 08:52.367
- Ah,
what do you need me for?
- 啊，
你需要我做什么？

08:52.367 --> 08:53.633
You got everything:
你得到了一切：

08:53.633 --> 08:55.267
a magic touch for cooking,
烹饪的魔力，

08:55.267 --> 08:56.567
lots of customers,
很多顾客，

08:56.567 --> 08:57.567
money.
钱。

08:57.567 --> 08:59.400
- I could use a boss.
- 我可以找个老板。

08:59.400 --> 09:01.167
Someone to
take all the credit
有人到
占据所有功劳

09:01.167 --> 09:02.267
and all the money.
和所有的钱。

09:02.267 --> 09:03.467
- Huh?
Hmm.
- 啊？
唔。

09:03.467 --> 09:07.800
Well, I suppose
I could do some bossing.
嗯，我想
我可以做一些发号施令的事情。

09:07.800 --> 09:10.633
How's 99% for me
and 1% for you?
我的99%怎么样
1%给你？

09:10.633 --> 09:12.367
- Oh, that's
more than generous!
- 哦，那是
何止慷慨！

09:15.400 --> 09:17.933
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

09:21.133 --> 09:24.867
Oh, no people are ever
coming back here.
哦，从来没有人
回到这里。

09:24.867 --> 09:26.467
Hey...
no people.
嘿...
没有人。

09:26.467 --> 09:27.800
That's great!
那太棒了！

09:27.800 --> 09:28.800
Because...
因为...

09:28.800 --> 09:31.467
I hate people!
我讨厌人！

09:31.467 --> 09:33.433
[laughs]
[笑]

09:33.433 --> 09:34.733
* I hate people
*我讨厌别人

09:34.733 --> 09:36.133
* People hate me
*人们讨厌我

09:36.133 --> 09:39.567
* I prefer my own best company
* 我更喜欢自己最好的公司

09:39.567 --> 09:40.867
* Single and secluded
* 单身且僻静

09:40.867 --> 09:42.367
* On my own
* 靠我自己

09:42.367 --> 09:45.267
* I can have the best of times
all alone *
*我可以享受最美好的时光
独自一人*

09:45.267 --> 09:47.633
* Because I hate
*因为我讨厌

09:47.633 --> 09:51.333
* People!
* 人们！

09:54.500 --> 09:57.600
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

09:57.600 --> 09:59.067
- [clears throat]
- Huh?
- [清喉咙]
- 啊？

09:59.067 --> 10:00.967
- Are you the owner
of this food establishment?
- 你是业主吗
这家食品店的？

10:00.967 --> 10:04.067
- Well, I do own
99% of SpongeBob's Place,
- 嗯，我确实拥有
99% 的海绵宝宝乐园，

10:04.067 --> 10:05.967
so I guess that's a yes.
所以我想这是肯定的。

10:05.967 --> 10:07.267
But you'll have to
stand in line
但你必须
排队

10:07.267 --> 10:08.800
if you want to
place an order.
如果你想
下订单。

10:08.800 --> 10:10.167
- Yeah, well,
I have an order for you.
- 是啊，好吧，
我有订单给你。

10:10.167 --> 10:12.133
An order to
shut down your restaurant.
一项命令
关闭你的餐馆。

10:12.133 --> 10:13.533
It's against
city health codes
这是反对
城市健康码

10:13.533 --> 10:14.833
to sell food
in a pineapple.
卖食物
在一个菠萝里。

10:14.833 --> 10:16.333
- [munching]
- [咀嚼]

10:16.333 --> 10:18.733
Say, Andy,
you gotta try these patties.
说，安迪，
你一定要尝尝这些馅饼。

10:18.733 --> 10:19.733
They're delicious.
它们很好吃。

10:19.733 --> 10:21.033
[smacks]
[咂嘴]

10:21.033 --> 10:22.167
- Carl, you're eating
contraband.
- 卡尔，你在吃东西
违禁品。

10:22.167 --> 10:24.200
- You're not
the boss of me.
- 你不是
我的老板。

10:24.200 --> 10:25.133
- Uh, yeah!
- 呃，是的！

10:25.133 --> 10:26.800
I totally am
the boss of you!
我完全是
你的老大！

10:26.800 --> 10:27.833
- Oh, what's going on?
- 哦，发生什么事了？

10:27.833 --> 10:29.800
- We've been shut down.
- 我们已经被关闭了。

10:29.800 --> 10:33.167
- Well, it was bun
while it lasted.
- 嗯，这是面包
当它持续的时候。

10:33.167 --> 10:34.300
[laughs]
[笑]

10:34.300 --> 10:35.600
- Meow!
- 喵！

10:35.600 --> 10:37.867
- You know, I know of
an empty restaurant
- 你知道，我知道
空荡荡的餐厅

10:37.867 --> 10:40.000
that's got
all its papers in order.
那有
所有文件均按顺序排列。

10:40.000 --> 10:41.467
We can move in
right away.
我们可以搬进来
马上。

10:41.467 --> 10:42.767
- Did you get rid of the ghost?
- 你把鬼魂赶走了吗？

10:42.767 --> 10:46.100
- Yeah, the ghost is gone.
- 是的，鬼魂消失了。

10:49.967 --> 10:52.100
- * I hate people,
I'm still that way *
- * 我讨厌别人，
我还是那样*

10:52.100 --> 10:53.633
* La, la, la, la, la, la,
hey, hey, hey! *
* 啦，啦，啦，啦，啦，啦，
嘿嘿嘿！ *

10:53.633 --> 10:55.367
- Sounds like
it's still haunted.
- 听起来像
它仍然闹鬼。

10:55.367 --> 10:56.467
- * I hate SpongeBob
- * 我讨厌海绵宝宝

10:56.467 --> 10:58.033
* I hate Krabs
*我讨厌螃蟹

10:58.033 --> 11:00.867
* I wish they'd leave the ocean
in taxi cabs *
*我希望他们离开海洋
在出租车里 *

11:00.867 --> 11:03.433
* And all the customers
can kiss my abs *
* 以及所有的顾客
可以亲吻我的腹肌*

11:03.433 --> 11:06.400
* 'Cause I'm
the one and only-- *
*因为我是
唯一的——*

11:06.400 --> 11:07.833
- Mr. Squidward!
- 章鱼哥先生！

11:07.833 --> 11:08.967
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

11:08.967 --> 11:10.533
And...uh...
还有……呃……

11:10.533 --> 11:13.400
oh...
哦...

11:13.400 --> 11:15.933
[customers laugh]
[顾客笑]

11:15.933 --> 11:17.833
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

11:19.500 --> 11:21.500
- You know, I've been doing
some thinking.
- 你知道，我一直在做
一些思考。

11:21.500 --> 11:23.500
You're a big part
of this place, boy-o,
你是一个很大的一部分
这个地方，男孩-o，

11:23.500 --> 11:26.367
and I believe I should
share the name with you.
我相信我应该
与您分享这个名字。

11:26.367 --> 11:27.300
Take a gander.
看看吧。

11:27.300 --> 11:28.933
- I don't get it, Mr. Krabs.
- 我不明白，蟹老板。

11:28.933 --> 11:29.933
It looks the same.
看起来是一样的。

11:29.933 --> 11:31.467
- Well, climb up there!
- 好吧，爬到那里去！

11:31.467 --> 11:33.300
Get a closer look.
仔细看看。

11:33.300 --> 11:35.467
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:35.467 --> 11:36.600
Where?
在哪里？

11:36.600 --> 11:39.433
- Under the words "Krusty Krab."
- 在“Krusty Krab”字样下。

11:39.433 --> 11:41.167
- "The Krusty Krab"...
- “蟹堡王”...

11:41.167 --> 11:42.067
[gasps]
[喘气]

11:42.067 --> 11:44.233
"And SpongeBob's Place."
“还有海绵宝宝的家。”

11:44.233 --> 11:47.167
Oh, Mr. Krabs, you're the best!
噢，蟹老板，你是最棒的！

11:47.167 --> 11:48.233
Whoo!
呼！

11:48.233 --> 11:49.433
[thuds]
[重击声]

11:49.433 --> 11:50.367
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

- [抱怨]